  "description": "End-to-end workflow to resolve a GitHub issue locally. Reads the issue, proposes a brief implementation plan, STOPS for user approval, then implements the change on a feature branch with atomic conventional commits referencing the issue. Never pushes — the user pushes manually after review. Use when the user says \"solve issue #N\", \"fix issue #N\", \"implement #N\", \"tackle issue #N\", or \"address issue #N\".",
